cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Automated iR Compensation: EIS fitting and LSV correction"
abstract: >-
  A Streamlit application for automated ohmic-drop (iR) compensation of
  linear-sweep voltammetry data, using the uncompensated resistance (Ru)
  estimated from an EIS Nyquist-arc circle fit.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-06-12"
